  "_about": "Scarcity (docs/notes/scarcity.md) as a mode of its own maps, as Blackout's (blackout-mode-1.json): each playable battery config (mode 2) of maps_dict once more (level_08 at night has no project: none) under gameplay/game_modes/scarcity/, with srp_variant scarcity (the server plays it as GameMode::Scarcity: the kits cut to the loaded magazines, the static info's Scarcity entry, for which exe patch 119 takes the ammo crates out of the map's project) and the mode's name st_srp_mode_scarcity; a maps_dict row each, ids 12 to 41 (the first free run of 30 below the stock ids; no u8 id above Blackout's 248 has room for 30) in the order of the battery ids. The configs name the battery maps' own projects: nothing of a project is copied. The test data (survarium game_data::test_archive) lays this list over its own configs.",
